    },
    "A few quick questions so your plants get care that fits your home.": {
      "comment": "Setup chat intro under the mascot",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umas perguntinhas rápidas para suas plantas receberem o cuidado certo para a sua casa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh haircut. I'll push new growth from there.": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'prune'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corte novo! Vou brotar a partir daí."
