    "A lot of yellowing. Check the roots and how wet the soil stays.": {
      "comment": "Photo read: leaf health summary, labelled as an estimate.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bastante amarelado. Confira as raízes e quanto tempo a terra fica molhada."
