    "A monthly photo, please. It helps us see how I'm changing.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request portrait, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma foto do mês, por favor. Ajuda a ver como estou mudando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new home! I might sulk a little while my roots settle. That's normal.": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'repot'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Casa nova! Talvez eu fique meio amuada enquanto as raízes se ajeitam. É normal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new leaf unfurled": {
      "comment": "Demo care log note",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma folha nova se abriu"
          }
        }
