    "A quarter turn every 2 weeks": {
      "comment": "Care plan value",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um quarto de volta a cada 2 semanas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick finger in the soil": {
      "comment": "Reminder kind subtitle in Settings, short and warm.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um dedinho rápido na terra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick soil hello for %@": {
      "comment": "Forecast line on Today/agenda, warm, no final period. Playful: check the soil. %@ = plant name.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um oi rapidinho para a terra de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shiny, sticky film means sap-suckers like scale or aphids are nearby.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma película brilhante e grudenta indica sugadores, como cochonilha ou pulgão, por perto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sick leaf": {
      "comment": "Scan mode tile title",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma folha doente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small mark on the pot helps you remember which way you turned.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma marquinha no vaso ajuda a lembrar para que lado você girou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A spa day for roots": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um dia de spa para as raízes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A thin layer of sand or grit makes the surface unwelcoming.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma camada fina de areia ou pedrisco deixa a superfície nada convidativa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tidy-up in spring": {
      "comment": "Reminder kind subtitle in Settings, short and warm.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma ajeitada na primavera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A timer makes it effortless. Plants need dark nights too.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um timer deixa tudo automático. As plantas também precisam de noites escuras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tray of wet pebbles under the pot adds a little moisture right where it's needed. Keep the pot above the water.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um prato com pedrinhas molhadas embaixo do vaso dá umidade bem onde precisa. Deixe o vaso acima da água."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A white crust on the soil or pot rim, and brown leaf tips, mean salts from tap water and food have built up.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crosta branca na terra ou na borda do vaso e pontas das folhas marrons indicam acúmulo de sais da água da torneira e do adubo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A white full-spectrum LED looks natural and gives plants everything they need.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um LED branco de espectro completo parece natural e dá tudo o que as plantas precisam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
