      "comment": "Photo diagnosis finding title: possible nutrient deficiency. %@ = nutrient name, lowercase.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pode ser fome (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could you feel my soil today? No rush.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request checkSoil, calm personality: gentle, unhurried, serene.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pode sentir minha terra hoje? Sem pressa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could you look after %@ until %@?": {
      "comment": "Cover request text; %1$@ plant name, %2$@ weekday",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pode cuidar de %1$@ até %2$@?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could you look after %lld plants until %@?": {
      "comment": "Cover request text; %1$lld plant count, %2$@ weekday",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pode cuidar de %1$lld plantas até %2$@?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could you peek at my drainage holes? Roots poking out means I need more room.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request checkRoots, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pode espiar meus furos de drenagem? Raiz saindo quer dizer que preciso de mais espaço."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't reach the weather service. I'll try again later.": {
      "comment": "Settings: climate download failed.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não consegui acessar o serviço de clima. Tento de novo mais tarde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t change the icon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
