      }
    },
    "Dries in": {
      "comment": "UI text in plant/plants/spaces screens; keep short like English",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seca em"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dries much faster than %@ wants.": {
      "comment": "Product scan verdict reason for one plant. Args are plant or species names, numbers.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seca bem mais rápido do que %@ quer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink time! My soil is dry.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request water, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hora da aguinha! Minha terra secou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drinks": {
      "comment": "Reminder kind title in Settings, playful. Max 22 chars.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reguinhas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drooping can mean thirst or too much water. Both stress my roots. Feel my soil: if it's dry, water me well. If it's wet, the roots may be suffocating, so let me dry out and check that my pot drains.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: drooping leaves explanation.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folha murcha pode ser sede ou água demais. Os dois estressam minhas raízes. Sinta minha terra: se estiver seca, me dá uma boa regada. Se estiver molhada, as raízes podem estar sufocando, então me deixa secar e confere se o vaso drena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Droopy leaf? Let's save it": {
      "comment": "Sign-in promise title",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folha caidinha? Bora salvar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry": {
      "comment": "Chat quick reply chip: soil feels dry; max 14 chars\nChat suggestion chip: the soil feels dry (pt: 'Seca', refers to a terra).\nSoil moisture quick reply chip\nSoil moisture state",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seca"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry air": {
      "comment": "Photo diagnosis finding title. Short.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ar seco"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry air in %@. Group plants together and water deeply when the soil is dry.": {
      "comment": "Season card. %@ = place.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ar seco em %@. Agrupe as plantas e regue bem quando a terra secar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry air, missed waterings, or salt build-up.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ar seco, regas esquecidas ou acúmulo de sais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry and crumbly: water. Cool and slightly damp: wait. Wet or muddy: definitely wait.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seca e esfarelando: regue. Fresca e levemente úmida: espere. Molhada ou barrenta: espere com certeza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry soil with yellowing: water deeply until it drains, then keep a steadier rhythm.": {
      "comment": "Photo diagnosis advice.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terra seca com amarelado: regue bem até escorrer e depois mantenha um ritmo mais constante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry soil… does that mean drink time?": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request water, curious personality: inquisitive, asks questions.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terra seca… quer dizer que é hora de beber?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry the roots, save the plant": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seque as raízes, salve a planta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry the top, trap the flies": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seque a superfície, pegue as mosquinhas"
