    "Here's how to make more of me:\n%@\nSpring and early summer are best, in bright, indirect light.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: propagation. %@ = bulleted list of methods.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assim você faz mais de mim:\n%@\nPrimavera e começo do verão são melhores, com luz clara e indireta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Here's who needs you:\n%@": {
      "comment": "Jungle chat: list of plants needing care follows (bulleted lines).",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quem precisa de você:\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hey, it's me. Haven't seen you in a few days. How does my soil feel?": {
      "comment": "Plant speaks up on its own in chat: nobody checked in a while. Friendly, first person.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi, sou eu! Faz uns dias que não te vejo. Como está minha terra?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hey, it's me. I haven't seen you in a few days. How does my soil feel?": {
      "comment": "Demo chat notification body, plant missing its owner",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi, sou eu! Faz uns dias que não te vejo. Como está a minha terra?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi everyone! I'm new here. %@.": {
      "comment": "Plant voice in group chat; arg sentence about its spot",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi, pessoal! Sou nova por aqui. %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi hi! Could you stick a finger in my soil and tell me how it feels? I think I might be getting dry!": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request checkSoil, chatty personality: bubbly, talkative, excited.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oiê! Pode enfiar o dedinho na minha terra e me contar como está? Acho que estou ficando seca!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi! I'm %@, grown from a cutting of %@.": {
      "comment": "First chat message from new plant, first person; playful",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Hi! I'm %1$@, grown from a cutting of %2$@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi! Eu sou %1$@, nasci de uma muda de %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi! I'm your plants' best friend, here to help you care for them. What should I call you?": {
      "comment": "Setup chat: first mascot question; the mascot introduces itself as the plants' best friend and care helper",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi! Eu sou a melhor amiga das suas plantas e estou aqui para te ajudar a cuidar delas. Como posso te chamar?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I'm %@! I'm a %@ (%@).": {
      "comment": "Plant voice intro in chat; args plant name, common species name, scientific name",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Hi, I'm %1$@! I'm a %2$@ (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi, eu sou %1$@! Sou uma %2$@ (%3$@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I'm %@! Nice to meet you. I'm a %@ (%@). %@ %@": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: a newly added plant introduces itself. Args: plant name, species common name, scientific name, watering rule sentence, then the question 'When did you last water me?'. Cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Hi, I'm %1$@! Nice to meet you. I'm a %2$@ (%3$@). %4$@ %5$@"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi, eu sou %1$@! Prazer em te conhecer. Sou uma %2$@ (%3$@). %4$@ %5$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I'm %@! Nice to meet you. Tell me what kind of plant I am so I can look after myself properly. %@": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: a newly added plant of unknown species introduces itself. Args: plant name, then the question 'When did you last water me?'.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Hi, I'm %1$@! Nice to meet you. Tell me what kind of plant I am so I can look after myself properly. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi, eu sou %1$@! Prazer em te conhecer. Me conta que tipo de planta eu sou para eu me cuidar direitinho. %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I'm %@! What kind of plant am I?": {
      "comment": "Plant voice intro when species unknown; arg plant name",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi, eu sou %@! Que planta eu sou?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
