    "I am PARCHED. A drink, please, before I wilt into legend.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request water, dramatic personality: over-the-top drama queen, theatrical, CAPS for emphasis (pt: 'dramática', exagerada).",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou SEQUINHA. Água, por favor, antes que eu murche e vire lenda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I am STARVING for nutrients. Well, a bit peckish. Some food?": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request feed, dramatic personality: over-the-top drama queen, theatrical, CAPS for emphasis (pt: 'dramática', exagerada).",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou MORRENDO de fome de nutrientes. Tá, só com um pouco de fome. Um adubinho?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I come from %@.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: where the species is native. %@ = region.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu venho de %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't find a plant that ticks every box. Try fewer wishes, like \"easy and pet-safe\".": {
      "comment": "Chat: no plant matches all wishes. Translate the example naturally (e.g. 'fácil e segura para pets').",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não achei uma planta que atenda a tudo. Tente menos desejos, tipo \"fácil e segura para pets\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't find that place. Try a nearby city.": {
      "comment": "Settings: place lookup failed.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não encontrei esse lugar. Tente uma cidade próxima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't see enough leaves to judge health.": {
      "comment": "Photo read: leaf health summary, labelled as an estimate.",
      "localizations": {
