        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vou pedir pra ver a terra em ~%lld dia"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vou pedir pra ver a terra em ~%lld dias"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm absolutely flourishing, darling.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat greeting when all is well, dramatic personality: over-the-top drama queen, theatrical, CAPS for emphasis (pt: 'dramática', exagerada).",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou simplesmente deslumbrante, meu bem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm back home": {
      "comment": "End travel",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voltei para casa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm comfortable and content today.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat greeting when all is well, calm personality: gentle, unhurried, serene.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoje estou confortável e em paz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm comfortable between %@ and %@. Keep me away from radiators, AC vents and cold drafts.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: temperature range. Args: formatted min and max temperatures. In Brazil: 'aquecedor', 'ar-condicionado', 'correntes de ar frio'.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "I'm comfortable between %1$@ and %2$@. Keep me away from radiators, AC vents and cold drafts."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fico confortável entre %1$@ e %2$@. Me deixa longe de aquecedor, saída de ar-condicionado e corrente de ar frio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm doing great today!": {
      "comment": "Plant chat greeting when all is well, cheerful personality: upbeat and sunny.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou ótima hoje!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm doing well! What are you up to today?": {
      "comment": "Plant chat greeting when all is well, curious personality: inquisitive, asks questions.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou bem! E você, o que vai fazer hoje?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm feeling quite dry. Whenever you can today, a slow drink would help me so much.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking, calm personality, very dry; gentle",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tô me sentindo bem sequinha. Quando puder hoje, uma regada lenta ia me ajudar demais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm flowering!": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'flower'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou florindo!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm great! Nice light, happy roots. Did you see my leaves?": {
      "comment": "Plant chat greeting when all is well, chatty personality: bubbly, talkative, excited.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou ótima! Luz boa, raízes felizes. Viu minhas folhas?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm growing and a bit hungry. A diluted feed with my next drink?": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request feed, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou crescendo e com uma fominha. Um adubo diluído na próxima rega?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm growing really well! I just pushed a new leaf.": {
      "comment": "Plant voice, first person, proud and happy",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou crescendo muito bem! Acabei de soltar uma folha nova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm growing slowly at this time of year, so please pause feeding until spring. Feeding a resting plant just builds up salts in my soil.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: no feeding in the resting season.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nessa época do ano cresço devagar, então pausa o adubo até a primavera, tá? Adubar planta em descanso só acumula sais na terra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm growing so much. A little snack this week would be lovely.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaks up on its own in chat with a gentle care nudge. First person, warm.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou crescendo muito! Um lanchinho essa semana ia ser uma delícia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm happiest above %lld%% humidity. Grouping plants or using a humidifier works better than misting, whose effect lasts only minutes.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: humidity advice. %lld = minimum humidity percent.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fico mais feliz com umidade acima de %lld%%. Agrupar plantas ou usar umidificador funciona melhor que borrifar, que dura só alguns minutos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm not sure about that one yet. Here's what I know for certain: %@ %@": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: fallback when the question isn't understood. Args: species tip, optional about text.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "I'm not sure about that one yet. Here's what I know for certain: %1$@ %2$@"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disso ainda não tenho certeza. O que eu sei com certeza: %1$@ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm on the non-toxic list for cats and dogs (ASPCA). Still, nibbling isn't good for either of us.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: plant is pet-safe.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou na lista de não tóxicas para gatos e cachorros (ASPCA). Mesmo assim, mordiscar não faz bem pra nenhum de nós."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm ready for some water whenever you are.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request water, calm personality: gentle, unhurried, serene.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou pronta para uma aguinha quando você puder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm resting this season. No food for now, please.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request pauseFeeding, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou descansando nesta estação. Nada de adubo por enquanto, por favor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm wilting over here. Truly. One slow, deep drink would bring me back to life.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking, dramatic personality, very dry; theatrical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tô murchando aqui. Sério mesmo. Uma regada lenta e caprichada me traria de volta à vida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I've been feeling a bit soggy lately. Could you check my soil before the next drink?": {
      "comment": "Plant speaks up on its own in chat: overwatered. Gentle, first person.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ando me sentindo meio encharcada. Pode sentir minha terra antes da próxima rega?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I've got it": {
      "comment": "Notification action: accept covering plant care; max 20 chars",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deixa comigo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud is taking a moment. Try the invite again in a little while.": {
      "comment": "Shared jungle: share creation failed",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O iCloud está demorando um pouquinho. Tente o convite de novo daqui a pouco."
