    "In autumn, a few weeks of nights a few degrees cooler than days triggers a new spike.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No outono, algumas semanas de noites uns graus mais frias que os dias fazem nascer uma haste nova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In my current setup I usually dry in about %lld days. I learned that from your soil checks.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: learned drying rhythm. %lld = days (plural).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "In my current setup I usually dry in about %lld day. I learned that from your soil checks."
                }
              },
