        }
      }
    },
    "In summer about every %lld–%lld days, in winter about every %lld–%lld days. Always feel the soil first.": {
      "comment": "Seasonal watering advice; summer and winter day ranges",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "In summer about every %1$lld–%2$lld days, in winter about every %3$lld–%4$lld days. Always feel the soil first."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No verão, a cada %1$lld–%2$lld dias; no inverno, a cada %3$lld–%4$lld dias. Sempre sinta a terra antes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In summer about every %lld–%lld days, in winter barely at all, a sip once a month. Always feel the soil first.": {
      "comment": "Seasonal watering advice; summer day range",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "In summer about every %1$lld–%2$lld days, in winter barely at all, a sip once a month. Always feel the soil first."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No verão, a cada %1$lld–%2$lld dias; no inverno, quase nada, um golinho por mês. Sempre sinta a terra antes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In summer, keep the pot in a saucer of water so the soil never dries.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No verão, deixe o vaso num pratinho com água para a terra nunca secar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
