    "It passed away": {
      "comment": "UI text in plant/plants/spaces screens; keep short like English",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ela morreu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's a plant now! Add to jungle": {
      "comment": "Propagation button on final stage",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Virou planta! Adicionar à selva"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's been a long time. Please check my soil today.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking, independent personality, very dry; terse",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faz tempo. Por favor, veja minha terra hoje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's been a long while since %@'s last drink. A slow, deep sip would mean the world.": {
      "comment": "Notification line; %@ plant name; plant very dry; tender",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faz tempo que %@ não bebe água. Uma regada lenta e caprichada faria toda a diferença."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's been a while since anyone checked on %@. It may be quietly thirsty.": {
      "comment": "Insight: missed check. %@ = plant name.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faz tempo que ninguém dá uma olhada em %@. Pode estar com sede quietinha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's cooler outside than it likes right now. Keep it indoors until nights stay above %@.": {
      "comment": "Climate fit. %@ = temperature.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lá fora está mais frio do que ela gosta agora. Deixe dentro de casa até as noites ficarem acima de %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's growing season. Could I have a little plant food with my next water?": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request feed, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "É época de crescer. Posso ganhar um adubinho na próxima rega?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's resting season, so feeding now only builds up salts. I'll remind you in spring.": {
      "comment": "Welcome care plan for a newly added plant.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "É época de descanso, então adubar agora só acumula sais. Eu te lembro na primavera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's winter, so unless my roots are rotting, let's wait for spring.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: don't repot in winter.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "É inverno, então, a não ser que minhas raízes estejam apodrecendo, vamos esperar a primavera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its history and photos are kept.": {
      "comment": "UI text in plant/plants/spaces screens; keep short like English",
