        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves usually perk up within a day. Crispy ones won't recover, so trim them once new growth appears.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As folhas costumam se animar em um dia. As torradinhas não voltam; corte quando surgirem folhas novas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaving": {
      "comment": "Travel plan: departure date row",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ida"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Less": {
      "comment": "Collapse list button; max 10 chars",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Less light, slower growth. Water a little less": {
      "comment": "Move what-if clause; no final period",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menos luz, cresce mais devagar. Regue um pouco menos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Less sun means slower drying. A metre back makes a real difference.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menos sol, terra secando mais devagar. Um metro para trás já faz diferença."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Less water, more light": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menos água, mais luz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let all extra water run out.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
