        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mudinhas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Okay": {
      "comment": "Placement fit rating. Max 12 chars.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ok"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Old lower leaves yellow naturally. On new leaves, check light and food.": {
      "comment": "Photo diagnosis advice.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folhas velhas de baixo amarelam naturalmente. Nas novas, confira luz e adubo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Olive, Pip, Juno, Willow": {
      "comment": "Comma-separated pet-name ideas for a plant; give local, playful names a native would pick, same count",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oliva, Pipoca, Juno, Salgueiro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On after you reopen the app.": {
      "comment": "Backup status after turning on",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ativado quando você abrir o app de novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On hot days, pots may need water morning and evening. Check early.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em dias quentes, os vasos podem precisar de água de manhã e à tarde. Confira cedinho."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On my shelf": {
      "comment": "Section",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na minha prateleira"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On your home screen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na sua tela de início"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. Your jungle backs up automatically.": {
      "comment": "Backup status, on",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ativado. Sua selvinha faz backup sozinha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a month or when dust is visible.": {
      "comment": "When to do this care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma vez por mês ou quando a poeira aparecer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a month, same spot, same angle.": {
      "comment": "When to do this care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma vez por mês, mesmo lugar, mesmo ângulo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a spike appears, don't move or turn the plant.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando a haste aparecer, não mude nem gire a planta de lugar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a week, while watering.": {
      "comment": "When to do this care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma vez por semana, na hora da rega."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One becomes many": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma vira várias"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One gentle note at %@": {
      "comment": "Reminder summary; %@ time like 9:00",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um recadinho às %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One year": {
      "comment": "Milestone title",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um ano"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only rainwater": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Só água de chuva"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the people you invite can see this jungle. It lives in iCloud, and members see plant names, photos and care, never your location or account.": {
      "comment": "Hub privacy footer",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Só quem você convidar vê esta selva. Ela fica no iCloud, e as pessoas veem nomes, fotos e cuidados das plantas, nunca sua localização ou sua conta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only use it if you've confirmed a pest on %@.": {
      "comment": "Product scan verdict reason for one plant. Args are plant or species names, numbers.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Só use se você confirmou uma praga em %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only when the top of the soil is dry for most plants.": {
      "comment": "When to do this care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Só quando a parte de cima da terra estiver seca, para a maioria das plantas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only your rough area (about 10 km) is used, to read your local climate and weather. It never leaves for anything else.": {
      "comment": "Location privacy footer",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Só usamos sua região aproximada (uns 10 km) pra ler o clima e a previsão locais. Ela nunca é usada pra mais nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ooh, a little humidity. Thank you!": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'mist'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oba, uma umidadezinha. Obrigada!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open": {
      "comment": "Ad call-to-action fallback button",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %@": {
