      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Others have today's care. Enjoy a day off.": {
      "comment": "Shared card: others' turn",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoje é com o pessoal. Aproveite a folga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Our care tips come from botanists and trusted plant sources like Kew Gardens and the ASPCA. Every plant is a little different, so trust your fingers in the soil too.": {
      "comment": "Settings footer",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nossas dicas vêm de botânicos e fontes confiáveis como o Kew Gardens e a ASPCA. Cada planta é de um jeito, então confie também no dedo na terra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Our jungle": {
      "comment": "Default shared jungle name for a couple; max 24 chars",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nossa selva"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outdoors": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short\nPlants filter chip; max 12 chars",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ao ar livre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outdoors in winter is too cold. Bring it in": {
      "comment": "Placement reason, no final period.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lá fora no inverno é frio demais. Traga para dentro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outdoors: dries faster, watch for pests": {
      "comment": "Move what-if clause",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ao ar livre: seca mais rápido, de olho nas pragas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overview": {
      "comment": "Care guide overview page\nPlant page segment; max 10 chars",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Visão geral"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owner": {
      "comment": "Member role",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dono"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pack damp moss around it and wrap with cling film, tied at both ends.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coloque musgo úmido em volta e enrole com filme plástico, amarrado nas duas pontas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pale and stretched": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pálida e esticada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pale growth": {
      "comment": "Photo diagnosis finding title. Short.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crescimento pálido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pale, patchy or oddly coloured leaves in the growing season.": {
      "comment": "When to do this care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folhas pálidas, manchadas ou com cor estranha na época de crescimento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parent": {
      "comment": "Fact label: mother plant; max 14 chars",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mãe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Partner, family or housemates. Take turns, never double-water.": {
      "comment": "Me card subtitle: invite pitch",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amor, família ou quem divide o apê. Revezem e nunca reguem em dobro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Patches are soft": {
      "comment": "Chat suggestion chip: brown patches are soft.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manchas moles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Patience and a sunny sill": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paciência e uma janela ensolarada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause": {
      "comment": "Pause step timer",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pausar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause feeding from mid-autumn to early spring. Resting plants can't use it and the salts pile up.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pare de adubar do meio do outono até o comecinho da primavera. Planta descansando não aproveita, e os sais se acumulam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause feeding until spring": {
      "comment": "Seasonal plant care to-do; short imperative",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause o adubo até a primavera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause the food": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pausa no adubo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paused until spring": {
      "comment": "Feeding paused in cool season; max 26 chars",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pausado até a primavera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peace lilies, snake plants, ferns and calatheas divide beautifully.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step tip",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lírio-da-paz, espada-de-são-jorge, samambaias e calatheas se dividem lindamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pearl": {
      "comment": "Demo plant nickname; pt-BR: a cute Brazilian nickname",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pérola"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peat-free compost or coco coir holds water and gives roots something soft to grow into.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terra vegetal ou fibra de coco segura água e dá às raízes algo macio para crescer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pebble tray": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pratinho de pedrinhas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peek at %@'s cutting and freshen its water": {
      "comment": "Forecast line on Today/agenda, warm, no final period. %@ = parent plant name.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dê uma olhada na muda de %@ e troque a água"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People": {
      "comment": "Hub section: members",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pessoas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perfect for plant-sitting. They see exactly what each plant needs.": {
      "comment": "Invite blurb, friends",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perfeito para quem cuida enquanto você viaja. Dá para ver exatamente o que cada planta precisa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perlite or pumice": {
      "comment": "Tool needed for a care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perlita ou pedra-pomes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perlite, pumice or bark make pockets of air. Roots breathe there, and that's what keeps rot away.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perlita, pedra-pomes ou casca de pinus criam bolsões de ar. As raízes respiram ali, e é isso que afasta o apodrecimento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Personality": {
      "comment": "Info row title",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personalidade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
