        }
      }
    },
    "Slow-release granules build up salts in dry-kept soil. Liquid feed is safer.": {
      "comment": "Product scan verdict reason for one plant. Args are plant or species names, numbers.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grânulos de liberação lenta acumulam sais em terra mantida seca. Adubo líquido é mais seguro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly, until a little drains out, then empty the saucer.": {
      "comment": "Watering method",
      "localizations": {
