          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terracotta breathes and dries fast, lovely for succulents. Plastic and glazed pots stay moist longer, kind to ferns.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O barro respira e seca rápido, ótimo para suculentas. Plástico e cerâmica esmaltada seguram umidade, bom para samambaias."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terracotta helps it dry out.": {
      "comment": "Welcome care plan for a newly added plant. Terracotta = vaso de barro.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vaso de barro ajuda a secar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terracotta or plastic?": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
