    },
    "Thank you for growing with us": {
      "comment": "Settings subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigado por crescer com a gente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you for looking after me. Let's check again in a week.": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'treat'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigada por cuidar de mim. Vamos conferir de novo em uma semana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you for looking after my plants": {
      "comment": "Share message for plant-sitter note",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigado por cuidar das minhas plantas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you!": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after any other care action.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigada!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you! I'll let my top soil dry before the next drink.": {
      "comment": "Demo chat reply from a chatty plant",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigada! Vou deixar a terrinha de cima secar antes da próxima rega."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for checking! My soil is dry, so I'd love a drink.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaking in chat, request water, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigada por conferir! Minha terra está seca, então eu adoraria uma regadinha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for the photo! It's in my timeline now.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: the plant thanks the user for a photo added to its growth timeline. Warm, first person (the plant speaks).",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigada pela foto! Já está na minha linha do tempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for turning me. Now I'll grow straight.": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'rotate'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigada por me girar. Agora vou crescer retinha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks! That tells me how fast pots dry out at your place.": {
      "comment": "Setup chat: mascot thanks after home conditions",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valeu! Assim eu sei com que rapidez a terra seca aí na sua casa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks.": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'water'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That invite didn't open. Ask for a fresh link.": {
      "comment": "Shared jungle: accepting invite failed",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esse convite não abriu. Peça um link novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's all": {
      "comment": "Setup chat chip: finish a multi-choice answer",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Só isso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The air feels": {
      "comment": "Home air humidity picker row, followed by dry/normal/humid",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O ar parece"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The air feels a bit dry. A soft mist would feel like home.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaks up on its own in chat with a gentle care nudge. First person, warm.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O ar está meio seco. Uma borrifada ia me fazer sentir em casa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bottom-soak trick": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O truque da rega por baixo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The day a new plant arrives.": {
      "comment": "When to do this care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No dia em que a planta nova chegar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The finger test": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O teste do dedo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first two weeks": {
      "comment": "Care guide subtitle; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As duas primeiras semanas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lime-haters": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As que odeiam calcário"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The little bump where a leaf joins the stem is where roots come from. Cut just below one.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O calombinho onde a folha encontra o caule é de onde saem as raízes. Corte logo abaixo de um."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most reliable fix. Misting feels nice but only lasts minutes.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A solução mais confiável. Borrifar é gostoso, mas dura só uns minutos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next two weeks": {
      "comment": "Section title, care calendar",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Próximas duas semanas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the owner": {
      "comment": "Role phrase",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "o dono"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pests that bother %@ most:\n%@\nCheck under my leaves and along the stems. A clear photo will help most.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: likely pests. Args: species common name, bulleted list of pests.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The pests that bother %1$@ most:\n%2$@\nCheck under my leaves and along the stems. A clear photo will help most."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As pragas que mais incomodam a %1$@:\n%2$@\nOlhe embaixo das minhas folhas e ao longo dos caules. Uma foto nítida ajuda muito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The right food, every time": {
      "comment": "Paywall benefit title; max 32 chars",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O adubo certo, sempre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shadow test": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O teste da sombra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The soil in your photo looks dry. Water slowly until it drains, then let it dry again. (Photo estimate: feel it to be sure.)": {
      "comment": "Welcome care plan for a newly added plant.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A terra na sua foto parece seca. Regue devagar até escorrer e depois deixe secar de novo. (Estimativa pela foto: sinta para ter certeza.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The soil in your photo looks dry. Water slowly until it drains, then let it stay lightly moist. (Photo estimate: feel it to be sure.)": {
      "comment": "Welcome care plan for a newly added plant.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A terra na sua foto parece seca. Regue devagar até escorrer e depois mantenha levemente úmida. (Estimativa pela foto: sinta para ter certeza.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The soil in your photo looks wet. Wait, then I'll ask for a soil check in a few days. (Photo estimate.)": {
      "comment": "Welcome care plan for a newly added plant.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A terra na sua foto parece molhada. Espere, que em alguns dias eu peço para checar a terra. (Estimativa pela foto.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sunniest window you have. Stretching is their way of asking for more.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A janela mais ensolarada da casa. Esticar é o jeito delas de pedir mais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their turns go back to the rest of you. They keep their own plants.": {
      "comment": "Remove member explanation",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A vez dessa pessoa volta para vocês. As plantas dela continuam com ela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then and now": {
      "comment": "Section title: first vs latest photo",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antes e agora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then water me, please. Slowly, until it drains.": {
      "comment": "Plant replies after the user reports how its soil feels. Plant speaks in first person; the terse one is the independent personality.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Então me rega, por favor. Devagar, até escorrer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are signs, but it's resting season. Wait for spring if you can.": {
      "comment": "Repot verdict explanation, cool season",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tem sinais, mas é época de descanso. Espere a primavera se der."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They catch their own food. Fertilizer and compost burn their roots.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elas caçam a própria comida. Adubo e composto queimam as raízes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They open the link and get the app": {
      "comment": "Invite how-it-works step",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pessoa abre o link e baixa o app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They share light, humidity and watering rhythm. Grouping them raises local humidity and makes care easier.": {
      "comment": "Welcome care plan for a newly added plant.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elas compartilham luz, umidade e ritmo de rega. Agrupar aumenta a umidade ao redor e facilita os cuidados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They share light, humidity and watering rhythm. Grouping them raises local humidity and makes care easier. Check them for pests before grouping.": {
      "comment": "Welcome care plan for a newly added plant.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elas compartilham luz, umidade e ritmo de rega. Agrupar aumenta a umidade ao redor e facilita os cuidados. Confira se há pragas antes de juntar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They sign in and join with one tap": {
      "comment": "Invite how-it-works step",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entra na conta e participa com um toque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things that most often trouble %@:\n%@": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: common problems. Args: species common name, bulleted list.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Things that most often trouble %1$@:\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O que mais costuma incomodar a %1$@:\n%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking of you. Come say hi.": {
      "comment": "Plant speaks up on its own in chat with a gentle care nudge. First person, warm.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pensando em você. Vem dar um oi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirst, heat or dry air. Feel the soil first.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sede, calor ou ar seco. Sinta a terra primeiro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirsty": {
      "comment": "Plant status badge. Max 14 chars.\nStatus pill on notification; max 16 chars",
