    "Winter dust blocks light. A gentle shower freshens everyone up.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A poeira do inverno bloqueia a luz. Um banho suave refresca todo mundo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Winter in %@ with the heating on. Less water, no food, and keep them away from radiators.": {
      "comment": "Season card. %@ = place. Radiators = aquecedores.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inverno em %@ com aquecedor ligado. Menos água, nada de adubo e longe do aquecedor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Winter in %@. Sleepy time: less water, no food, keep them off cold glass.": {
