    "Yellow and soft": {
      "comment": "Care guide step title; short",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amarela e mole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow leaves have a few possible causes. I was watered %@ and I usually take about %lld days to dry, so too much water is the first thing to check. Feel my soil 3–4 cm deep before giving more.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: yellow leaves, likely overwatering. Args: relative day ('yesterday', '3 days ago'), number of days to dry (plural).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Yellow leaves have a few possible causes. I was watered %1$@ and I usually take about %2$lld day to dry, so too much water is the first thing to check. Feel my soil 3–4 cm deep before giving more."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Yellow leaves have a few possible causes. I was watered %1$@ and I usually take about %2$lld days to dry, so too much water is the first thing to check. Feel my soil 3–4 cm deep before giving more."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Folha amarela pode ter algumas causas. Fui regada %1$@ e costumo levar uns %2$lld dia para secar, então excesso de água é a primeira coisa a checar. Sinta minha terra a 3–4 cm de profundidade antes de regar de novo."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Folha amarela pode ter algumas causas. Fui regada %1$@ e costumo levar uns %2$lld dias para secar, então excesso de água é a primeira coisa a checar. Sinta minha terra a 3–4 cm de profundidade antes de regar de novo."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow leaves have a few possible causes. If it's only one old leaf at the bottom, that's normal ageing. If several leaves are yellowing, check whether my soil stays wet for long, and whether my pot drains.": {
      "comment": "Plant chat: yellow leaves explanation.",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folha amarela pode ter algumas causas. Se for só uma folha velha lá embaixo, é envelhecimento normal. Se várias estiverem amarelando, veja se minha terra fica molhada por muito tempo e se meu vaso drena bem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow leaves, soggy soil, a sour smell.": {
      "comment": "When to do this care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folhas amarelas, terra encharcada, cheiro azedo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow sticky traps": {
      "comment": "Tool needed for a care guide",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Armadilhas adesivas amarelas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow sticky traps catch fungus gnats and show you what's flying.": {
      "comment": "Care guide step tip",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Armadilhas adesivas amarelas pegam mosquinhas e mostram quem está voando por aí."
