    "Yes! A new leaf. I'm proud of it.": {
      "comment": "Plant thanks the user after care action 'newLeaf'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations": {
