    "Your climate": {
      "comment": "Climate settings section title",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu clima"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your climate, your home and this week's weather all change how much water and food they need. Tell me a little and I'll do the maths.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu clima, sua casa e o tempo desta semana mudam quanta água e adubo elas precisam. Me conta um pouco que eu faço as contas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your daily note": {
      "comment": "Settings group title for daily notification",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
