    },
    "Your jungle has %lld plants, the free limit. My Tiny Jungle Plus lets it grow without limits.": {
      "comment": "Jungle chat: free plan plant limit reached. %lld = number of plants. Keep 'My Tiny Jungle Plus' in English.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
